  "description": "Field Level Security Info is an XrmToolBox plugin for Microsoft Dynamics 365 and Dataverse.\n\nThe tool allows administrators and developers to:\n\n• View all Field Security Profiles\n• View secured columns associated with each profile\n• View assigned users and teams\n• Display field permissions (Create, Read, Update)\n• Open Field Security Profiles directly in Power Platform Admin Center\n• Quickly audit field-level security configuration\n\nThis tool helps simplify security reviews and troubleshooting in Dynamics 365 and Dataverse environments.",
