  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.0.0\n\nInitial release\n\nFeatures:\n• List Field Security Profiles\n• Expandable Columns, Users, and Teams sections\n• Permission display (Create, Read, Update)\n• Direct profile navigation\n• Dataverse and Dynamics 365 support\n• XrmToolBox integration",
